    {
      "id": "S13",
      "act": 3,
      "title": "Slow on purpose",
      "transitionIn": "push",
      "shots": [
        {
          "visual": "TextStack",
          "props": {
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "Make each guess expensive",
                "step": 0,
                "tone": "teal"
              },
              {
                "text": "slow on purpose · tunable as hardware improves",
                "serif": false,
                "size": 44,
                "tone": "slate",
                "step": 1
              },
              {
                "text": "bcrypt · 1999",
                "mono": true,
                "tone": "amber",
                "step": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S13_01",
              "vo": "So the real fix is to make each guess expensive."
            },
            {
              "id": "S13_02",
              "vo": "Password hashing functions are built to be slow on purpose, and the slowness can be turned up as hardware gets faster."
            },
            {
              "id": "S13_03",
              "vo": "B crypt arrived in nineteen ninety-nine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "visual": "GuessStream",
          "props": {
            "title": "same RTX 4090 · slow hashes",
            "note": "drawn far from scale: bcrypt here is about 900,000× slower than MD5",
            "phases": [
              {
                "label": "bcrypt (cost 5)",
                "rate": "184 thousand / s",
                "sub": "same 2.8 trillion: about 177 days",
                "perFrame": 0.07,
                "step": 0
              },
              {
                "label": "scrypt",
                "rate": "7,126 / s",
                "sub": "same 2.8 trillion: about 12.5 years",
                "perFrame": 0.02,
                "step": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S13_04",
              "vo": "On the same card, B crypt at a low setting manages about a hundred and eighty-four thousand guesses a second. That same set of passwords now takes about half a year."
            },
            {
              "id": "S13_05",
              "vo": "S crypt arrived in two thousand nine. It also makes each guess use a lot of memory, to blunt custom cracking hardware."
            },
            {
              "id": "S13_06",
              "vo": "At the tested setting, the card manages about seven thousand guesses a second. About twelve and a half years for the same set."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "act": 3,
      "title": "Argon2",
      "transitionIn": "fade",
      "shots": [
        {
          "visual": "TextStack",
          "props": {
            "kicker": "what good sites run",
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "Argon2id",
                "size": 130,
                "tone": "teal",
                "step": 0
              },
              {
                "text": "OWASP recommends · from Argon2, competition winner 2015",
                "serif": false,
                "size": 40,
                "tone": "slate",
                "step": 0
              },
              {
                "text": "minimum: 19 MiB memory · 2 passes · 1 lane",
                "mono": true,
                "size": 44,
                "tone": "amber",
                "step": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S14_01",
              "vo": "The Oh wasp guidance on password storage recommends Argon two I D. It comes from Argon two, which won an open password hashing competition in twenty fifteen."
            },
            {
              "id": "S14_02",
              "vo": "Its minimum setting uses about twenty megabytes of memory and two rounds of work for every single guess."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "visual": "CodeCard",
          "props": {
            "title": "what the database stores for you",
            "code": "# algorithm + settings · salt · hash\n$argon2id$v=19$m=19456,t=2,p=1\n$cE3JU6U6szy6uvAh96bkyw\n$Pr8MGyxkXWUs/ALFyQ4a+2IS3skjs84BpY4YSDhLGFM",
            "caption": "Settings travel with the hash, so the cost can be raised later"
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S14_03",
              "vo": "In a common library's format, the stored value carries its own recipe. One line holds the algorithm and its settings. Then the salt. Then the hash."
            },
            {
              "id": "S14_04",
              "vo": "Because the settings travel with the hash, a site can raise the cost later. It re-hashes your password the next time you log in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "visual": "TextStack",
          "props": {
            "kicker": "optional extra layer",
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "Pepper",
                "size": 130,
                "tone": "amber",
                "step": 0
              },
              {
                "text": "one secret, kept outside the database",
                "serif": false,
                "size": 44,
                "step": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S14_05",
              "vo": "Some sites add one more layer, called a pepper. It's a single secret kept outside the database, so a stolen table alone isn't enough to start guessing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "visual": "TextStack",
          "props": {
            "kicker": "grocery_app.users · leaked today",
            "lines": [
              {
                "text": "a salt and a slow fingerprint per row",
                "step": 0,
                "size": 60
              },
              {
                "text": "every guess costs real time",
                "tone": "teal",
                "step": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "beats": [
            {
              "id": "S14_06",
              "vo": "So picture the grocery app's table leaking today. Each row gives an attacker a salt and a slow fingerprint, and every guess costs real time."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
