              "id": "S17_02",
              "vo": "Your browser or app hashes the password with S H A one, and sends only the first five characters to the service Have I Been Poned."
            },
            {
              "id": "S17_03",
              "vo": "The service returns the endings of matching leaked hashes in its database. Your device checks its own ending against that list."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
